1
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:05,236
Did you lock the door behind you?

2
00:00:05,436 --> 00:00:06,774
I thought you did.

3
00:00:07,774 --> 00:00:10,708
Never mind. We have ten minutes.

4
00:00:10,808 --> 00:00:13,353
Ten minutes for what, exactly?

5
00:00:13,853 --> 00:00:16,648
To find the tape before they come back.

6
00:00:18,848 --> 00:00:20,714
You said it was in the office.

7
00:00:20,914 --> 00:00:23,539
It was. Someone moved it.

8
00:00:23,939 --> 00:00:26,444
Then how do you know it is still here?

9
00:00:27,244 --> 00:00:29,879
Because nobody has left the building.

10
00:00:30,179 --> 00:00:32,295
That is not very comforting.

11
00:00:35,095 --> 00:00:38,259
Check the cabinet. I will take the desk.

12
00:00:39,359 --> 00:00:40,497
It is locked.

13
00:00:40,597 --> 00:00:42,075
Of course it is.

14
00:00:54,675 --> 00:00:56,971
Wait. I found something.

15
00:00:57,271 --> 00:00:58,549
Is it the tape?

16
00:00:58,749 --> 00:01:01,304
No. It is a photograph of us.

17
00:01:02,704 --> 00:01:04,201
That is impossible.

18
00:01:04,401 --> 00:01:06,288
Look at the date on the back.

19
00:01:07,488 --> 00:01:08,407
Tomorrow.

20
00:01:08,907 --> 00:01:11,332
Somebody is playing a game with us.

21
00:01:11,632 --> 00:01:12,900
Or warning us.

22
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,418
Did you hear that?

23
00:01:18,618 --> 00:01:20,814
The elevator. They are early.

24
00:01:21,414 --> 00:01:23,011
What do we do now?

25
00:01:23,511 --> 00:01:26,096
We take the photograph and we run.

26
00:01:26,996 --> 00:01:28,723
I knew you would say that.

